      {
        "title": "Yolks meet Topfen.",
        "text": "Separate the eggs. Stir the Topfen with the 2 yolks (and the sour cream, if using) until well mixed.",
        "cue": "Smooth and creamy."
      },
      {
        "title": "Flavour it.",
        "text": "Add flour, sweetener, lemon zest and salt. Stiff? A splash of water.",
        "cue": "Thick but creamy."
      },
      {
        "title": "Whip + fold.",
        "text": "Beat the whites stiff and slowly fold them in.",
        "cue": "Quite a firm batter: that's normal."
      },
      {
        "title": "Low and slow.",
        "text": "Melt the fat on MEDIUM heat. Spread the batter 0.5–1 cm thick. Fry ~5 min until it starts to set, flip, ~5 min more.",
        "cue": "Golden at most, never dark."
      },
      {
        "title": "Lid on, chill out.",
        "text": "Heat off, lid on, let it sit 5 min.",
        "cue": "Set all the way through."
      },
      {
        "title": "Tear + top.",
        "text": "Lid off, tear into pieces, pile on fruit or compote.",
        "cue": "Fluffy, golden chunks."
